  labels: [
    "sticker, read from an operator photograph 2026-10-16: S/N 1583323120274, Model: P4261, 694-24261-0000-201 E1, Made In USA. Its part number differs from the K1 listing's 694-24261-0000-100 K1 in the suffix as well as the revision; what -201 against -100 selects is not established",
