  j20_connector: "J20, a black shrouded 2 x 9 receptacle on the left edge, its positions keyed square and rounded, with a latch on one long side; its positions, what continuity joins them to and its polarity are the housing and the measured circuit below. Caliper, 2026-10-16: 26.32 mm from the inner left wall of a row's first cavity to the outer right wall of its ninth (eight pitches plus one cavity), and 5.27 mm from the top wall of the supply row's ninth cavity to the bottom wall of the ground row's ninth (one row pitch plus one cavity). With square cavities both fit a 3.0 mm pitch on both axes and a cavity of about 2.3 mm, and both exclude a 4.2 mm pitch (Mini-Fit Jr); the family is unread, and Molex Micro-Fit 3.0 is the candidate those dimensions match",
